# Security headers for every response served by Cloudflare Pages.
# Semrush site audit flagged Strict-Transport-Security as missing on / and the
# product hubs; HSTS is emitted here (max-age only — no includeSubDomains so the
# media subdomain keeps its own policy).
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Edge caching for HTML.
#
# Cloudflare Pages answers every static asset with
#   Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
# by default. The edge reads that as "do not store" and marks each request
# cf-cache-status: DYNAMIC, so even Googlebot hits the origin every single
# time. Measured TTFB then sits at 1.2-2.4s for a normal page and 5-9.5s for
# the heavy hubs (/products/strollers/ alone is 113KB), and Google responds to
# a slow origin by throttling itself. That is why 243 URLs have been stuck in
# "Discovered - currently not indexed" with Last crawled = N/A since July:
# they were never fetched, not fetched and rejected.
#
# Cloudflare honors our header verbatim but then appears to read only max-age
# when deciding eligibility: max-age=0 with s-maxage=86400 (and
# Cloudflare-CDN-Cache-Control to the same effect) stayed DYNAMIC across
# repeated requests, while robots.txt and /assets/*, which carry Cloudflare's
# own positive max-age, come back REVALIDATED out of the cache.
#
# So max-age carries a positive window here. Pages purges on every deploy, so
# the edge never serves retired content; the trade is that a browser may reuse
# a page for up to that window before revalidating. Swap this for a dashboard
# Cache Rule (Eligible for cache + Edge TTL, Browser TTL = Respect origin) to
# get max-age=0 back for browsers while keeping the edge. robots.txt and
# /assets/* are not matched by these rules and keep whatever they already had.

/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate

/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate

/about*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate

/guides*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate

/news*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate

/products*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate

/reviews*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate

/transparency*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=14400, must-revalidate
